{"c":{"53241":["Yuugo Hachiken","Male","b53241-QYm6Wc1z8Yj1.png","The main character of Silver Spoon, he enrolls in Yezo High, an agricultural school, to get away from his parents.",373],"53243":["Aki Mikage","Female","n53243-OwJ1Hv4Gg8wK.png","A member of the equestrian club, she loves horses and grew up on a farm. She is expected to eventually take over the family farm, however she remains uncertain if that is what she herself wishes to do.",137],"59771":["Shinnosuke Aikawa","Male","n59771-0v27I6PBM67b.png","Shinnosuke's goal is to become a veterinarian however, he first has to overcome his dilemma with the practice of euthanasia on animals.",12],"59773":["Tamako Inada","Female","n59773-jPE4sRH2fwIX.png","Round like an egg as her name implies (tamago means egg in Japanese), Tamako is a 1st Year Dairy Farming Program student who is not afraid to speak her mind. She excels in accounting and is obsessed with micromanaging money.",26],"59775":["Ichirou Komaba","Male","n59775-Hv7sufuaaafD.png","One of Yugo's close friends and a skilled baseball player who dreams of becoming a professional and make use of the money earned on the league to improve his family's dairy farm.",46],"82731":["Keiji Tokiwa",null,"n82731-x5VToEAlZkpk.png","A close friend of Yugo who has the​ talent to put himself in trouble due to his difficulty to study and his habit to jump too quickly into conclusions, much to his friends' chagrin. His family owns a chicken farm.",13],"82755":["Mayumi Yoshino","Female","82755.jpg","She's a first year in the diary program and used to be at Shimourahoro Middle School. She wants to start a cheese factory using her family dairy farm's milk.",21],"127972":["Yoshiyuki Nakajima","Male","n127972-BMz0aCzH42AF.png","He is a teacher at Yezo Agricultural High School. He is one of the first people that Hachiken meets.",6],"127973":["Tarou Beppu","Male","n127973-JoF2cLACd6zs.png","Tarou is a first-year student currently attending Yezo Agricultural High School. He is in the Food Science department.",4],"127974":["Ichiko Fuji ","Female","n127974-hGjCiMGrJVr9.png","",10],"127975":["Misako Hachiken","Female","n127975-mE7ZcxLJlfbz.png","",0],"127976":["Kouji Futamata","Male","n127976-GB3eKHyxgMTX.png","",0],"127977":["Shingo Hachiken","Male","n127977-IyeiaKY0qlsw.png","He's Yugo's brother.",2],"127978":["Kazumasa Hachiken",null,"n127978-B1AHRJ6yThkk.png","",2],"127979":["Hirono",null,"n127979-c0E4ZtxMUETe.png","",0],"127980":["Chidori Ikeda",null,"n127980-C3rlmRiTOjNz.png","",1],"127981":["Inada Haha","Female","n127981-veT8cE8UV4rl.png","Tamako's mother.",0],"127984":["Inada Chichi","Male","n127984-yaRKcX7NON1s.png","Tamako's father.",0],"127985":["Shinichirou Inada",null,"n127985-IXdmxnFqGU38.png","Tamako's brother",4],"127986":["Juui",null,"n127986-2RbmJGQn3Jyv.png","",0],"127987":["Minami Kitamachi",null,"n127987-xABF2G6RLfs8.png","",0],"127988":["Misora Komaba",null,"n127988-RJywjf3ryzDa.png","",1],"127989":["Nino Komaba",null,"n127989-n2ryGlpkgMYp.png","",1],"127990":["Komaba Haha","Female","n127990-suVOwmBTZcAN.png","",1],"127991":["Noboru Maruyama",null,"n127991-U9XVR2Oxj0VV.png","",0],"127992":["Yuuichi Matsuyama",null,"n127992-PWv9rci1wzij.png","",0],"127993":["Mikage Haha","Female","n127993-VDooMTtVvLVF.png","",0],"127994":["Goushi Mikage",null,"n127994-rLw8B3k0Q8U9.png","",1],"127995":["Mikage Sobo","Female","n127995-gMPYECwCoe7z.png","",0],"127998":["Mikage Sofu","Male","n127998-JOIQPaM4iOPP.png","",2],"127999":["Mikage Sousobo","Female","n127999-jEbbylp7ecB1.png","",4],"128000":["Uncle Mikage","Male","n128000-0LAihT43ieI0.png","",0],"128001":["Masataka Minami",null,"n128001-Of2ET88xAjXE.png","",0],"128002":["Hajime Nishikawa","Male","n128002-ACeF81NaSBdg.png","Hajime is a first-year student currently attending Yezo Agricultural High School. His family grows potatoes.",7],"128003":["Itsuki Shirakaba",null,"n128003-Ba4Vdmv10B96.png","",0],"128004":["Shinei Ookawa",null,"n128004-HMrpr2AxCDJT.png","",4],"128005":["Chikara Ootanis